{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/f553a9efa7c37a80632fe46b48250f6b.avif?t=1754819468\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras_big/f553a9efa7c37a80632fe46b48250f6b.avif?t=1754819468 width=800 height=451 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6Synopsis\u25c6</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asahi, the protagonist, is a young man living in the defensive city of Asgard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He inherited his grandmother's restaurant \u201cNorn's Dine\u201d, named after the goddess of \u201cdestiny\u201d, and spends his days as a chef who is well known for his skill and amiable personality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is \u201cFate's Table\u201d - the story of Asahi's \u201cdestiny\u201d with the people she meets at Norn's Dine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6About the game\u25c6</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/8bc4efe0e92c61f41a36d70477a5d0fb.avif?t=1754819468\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras_big/8bc4efe0e92c61f41a36d70477a5d0fb.avif?t=1754819468 width=800 height=567 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Norn's Dine\u201d is an 18-rated BL novel game in which players interact with a variety of unique characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By selecting the characters who visit the store, the likability level increases and unique episodes are released.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you deepen your bond and have more episodes, you will be able to enjoy\u00a0erotic scenes with the person you have become intimate with\u2026\u2026</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6Character Introductions\u25c6</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>vol.1 Selectable character</u></strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/e256de3dd424738d189f2dbc66cf421e.avif?t=1754819468\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras_big/e256de3dd424738d189f2dbc66cf421e.avif?t=1754819468 width=800 height=450 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Frederick\u3011\u3000<strong><u>\u203bvol.1 Selectable character</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age\uff1a35\u3000Race\uff1aHuman\u00a0 \u00a0Occupation\uff1aKnight Commander</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height\uff1a190cm\u3000Weight\uff1a110kg</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The head of the knights who protect Asgard. Though he can be rather rigid, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >his abilities and character make him an exemplary knight. He is the eldest son of a </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >noble family, but has a strained relationship with his household.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/d0c45f77b19b910f1ea831c809a904f1.avif?t=1754819468\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras_big/d0c45f77b19b910f1ea831c809a904f1.avif?t=1754819468 width=800 height=451 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Orfeo\u3011\u3000<strong><u>\u203bvol.1 Selectable character</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age\uff1a40\u3000Race\uff1aBeastman\uff08Tiger\uff09Occupation\uff1aMafia Boss</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height\uff1a203cm\u3000Weight\uff1a150kg</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The boss of a mafia faction that controls Asgard from the shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He has a tough appearance, but deep down, he has a heart of gold and is quite fond of children.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While highly capable in combat, he is more of a black market mafioso.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/f6f5707564715aa95083db3a794a57b6.avif?t=1754819468\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras_big/f6f5707564715aa95083db3a794a57b6.avif?t=1754819468 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Shido\u3011\u3000<strong><u>\u203bvol.1 Selectable character</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age\uff1a32\u3000Race\uff1aBeastman\uff08bull\uff09Occupation\uff1aAdventurer\uff08\uff1f\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height\uff1a199cm\u3000Weight\uff1a125kg</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mysterious half-beast bull who Asahi found passed out. Due to his amnesia, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >he has no recollection of his past. His behavior is often compared to that of a child,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >lacking in common sense and moral awareness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/3191b19b9b565911e3df263aa4c14b3c.avif?t=1754819468\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras_big/3191b19b9b565911e3df263aa4c14b3c.avif?t=1754819468 width=800 height=451 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Giulio\u3011\u3000<strong><u>\u203bvol.1 Selectable character</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age\uff1a24\u3000Race\uff1aHuman\u3000Occupation\uff1aAdventurer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height\uff1a178cm\u3000Weight\uff1a100kg</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Asahi's childhood friend. He\u2019s friendly with everyone and often comes across as frivolous,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >but he\u2019s very compassionate. Comes from a tribe of warriors that hold battle in high regard, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and is currently undergoing rigorous training.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Additional DLC Character</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/3c89a0a12a48ba7987e4ec39c4354d62.avif?t=1754819468\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras_big/3c89a0a12a48ba7987e4ec39c4354d62.avif?t=1754819468 width=800 height=451 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Grant\u3011\u3000<strong><u>\u203bAdditional DLC Character</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age\uff1a36\u3000Race\uff1aDemon\u3000Occupation\uff1aGuildmaster</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height\uff1a188cm\u3000Weight\uff1a95kg</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The master of the Adventurers' Guild who was a skilled adventurer himself</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in his younger days. An old friend of Frederick's.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/b71380f4de8523392b1549576e0e7d60.avif?t=1754819468\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras_big/b71380f4de8523392b1549576e0e7d60.avif?t=1754819468 width=800 height=451 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Rito\u3011\u3000<strong><u>\u203bAdditional DLC Character</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age\uff1a20\u3000Race\uff1ahalf-beast\uff08Dog\uff09Occupation\uff1aWaiter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height\uff1a190cm\u3000Weight\uff1a100kg</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gentle and kind-hearted half-beast whose appaearance resembles a large dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He is in charge of cooking and serving the customers at Norn's Dine, always </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >wearing a smile and serving as a cheerful mood-maker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/b333d77d9adae33273ea1d368aa523a1.avif?t=1754819468\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras_big/b333d77d9adae33273ea1d368aa523a1.avif?t=1754819468 width=800 height=451 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Lucas\u3011\u3000<strong><u>\u203bAdditional DLC Character</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age\uff1a28\u3000Race\uff1aHuman\u3000Occupation\uff1aAdventurer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height\uff1a185cm\u3000Weight\uff1a88kg</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adventurer who was taken by Asahi's parents when they were both at a very young age, making them brothers by bond. He's not exactly mute, but he often struggles to express his emotions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/3aeee9e5f191d6606330cf2ed4df3dfc.avif?t=1754819468\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras_big/3aeee9e5f191d6606330cf2ed4df3dfc.avif?t=1754819468 width=800 height=451 /></span>\u3010Laplace\u3011\u3000<strong><u>\u203bAdditional DLC Character</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age\uff1aHow old do you think I am?\u3000Race\uff1aIt's a secret!\u3000Occupation\uff1aYou work, you lose!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height\uff1a173cm\u3000Weight\uff1a70kg</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young man with a deeply problematic personality who calls h