LC Character</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/3c89a0a12a48ba7987e4ec39c4354d62.avif?t=1754819468\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras_big/3c89a0a12a48ba7987e4ec39c4354d62.avif?t=1754819468 width=800 height=451 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Grant\u3011\u3000<strong><u>\u203bAdditional DLC Character</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age\uff1a36\u3000Race\uff1aDemon\u3000Occupation\uff1aGuildmaster</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height\uff1a188cm\u3000Weight\uff1a95kg</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The master of the Adventurers' Guild who was a skilled adventurer himself</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >in his younger days. An old friend of Frederick's.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/b71380f4de8523392b1549576e0e7d60.avif?t=1754819468\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras_big/b71380f4de8523392b1549576e0e7d60.avif?t=1754819468 width=800 height=451 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Rito\u3011\u3000<strong><u>\u203bAdditional DLC Character</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age\uff1a20\u3000Race\uff1ahalf-beast\uff08Dog\uff09Occupation\uff1aWaiter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height\uff1a190cm\u3000Weight\uff1a100kg</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gentle and kind-hearted half-beast whose appaearance resembles a large dog.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He is in charge of cooking and serving the customers at Norn's Dine, always </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >wearing a smile and serving as a cheerful mood-maker.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/b333d77d9adae33273ea1d368aa523a1.avif?t=1754819468\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras_big/b333d77d9adae33273ea1d368aa523a1.avif?t=1754819468 width=800 height=451 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3010Lucas\u3011\u3000<strong><u>\u203bAdditional DLC Character</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age\uff1a28\u3000Race\uff1aHuman\u3000Occupation\uff1aAdventurer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height\uff1a185cm\u3000Weight\uff1a88kg</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An adventurer who was taken by Asahi's parents when they were both at a very young age, making them brothers by bond. He's not exactly mute, but he often struggles to express his emotions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras/3aeee9e5f191d6606330cf2ed4df3dfc.avif?t=1754819468\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3664240/extras_big/3aeee9e5f191d6606330cf2ed4df3dfc.avif?t=1754819468 width=800 height=451 /></span>\u3010Laplace\u3011\u3000<strong><u>\u203bAdditional DLC Character</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Age\uff1aHow old do you think I am?\u3000Race\uff1aIt's a secret!\u3000Occupation\uff1aYou work, you lose!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Height\uff1a173cm\u3000Weight\uff1a70kg</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A young man with a deeply problematic personality who calls himself a bard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He sometimes appears before Asahi, sings some cryptic words, and just as</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >suddenly, vanishes without a trace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3